This product is a Flutter port of Sea Glass for Compose by Matt McKenna
(https://github.com/mttmcknn/sea-glass), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

Adapted from that project:
- Outline generation, seeded random and geometry field
  (from web/dist/sea-glass.mjs)
- The material body shader (from SeaGlassBodyShader.kt)
- Shadow and light-pool parameters (from web/dist/sea-glass.mjs)
- Recipe defaults, presets, palettes and the public API design
  (from SeaGlassStyle.kt, SeaGlassTheme.kt, SeaGlassMaterialTheme.kt and
  SeaGlass.kt)

These parts were modified for Flutter. Each adapted file states what it was
ported from. The Flutter rendering, caching, widgets and example app are
original to this package.
